lazy\\\"><div class=\\\"project-title\\\"><h3>Hillside Retreat</h3><span>Residential \\xc2\\xb7 2025 \\xe2\\x86\\x97</span></div></a></article></div></section>\\n<section class=\\\"invitation wrap\\\"><p>Have something in mind?</p><h2>Let's make<br><em>room for it.</em></h2><a class=\\\"button light\\\" href=\\\"/studio#contact\\\">Meet your architects \\xe2\\x86\\x97</a></section>\\n<div class=\\\"render-note wrap\\\">\",(if p_server then concat(\"A complete HTML document, rendered for this request.<span>Request timestamp <code>\",int_text(p_stamp),\"</code></span>\") else \"A complete HTML document, rendered at build time.<span>Static export snapshot</span>\"),\"</div>\\n\")"
expression Page_5b0f3f2119 "\"<article class=\\\"studio wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">THE STUDIO</span><h1>A small studio.<br><em>A long view.</em></h1><div class=\\\"studio-body\\\"><p class=\\\"lead\\\">We bring calm thinking and a hands-on approach to the spaces you call your own.</p><div><h2>Built around people</h2><p>Every project begins with a conversation, not a drawing. How do you spend your mornings? Where does the light fall? What would make an ordinary day a little better?</p><p>We work from those details outward, using natural materials and clear ideas to create places that will grow with you.</p></div></div><div class=\\\"studio-projects\\\"><section id=\\\"courtyard\\\"><img src=\\\"/courtyard.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Courtyard House illustration\\\" width=\\\"720\\\" height=\\\"680\\\"><h2>Courtyard House</h2><p>A home turned inward toward a quiet garden. Deep window reveals, limewashed walls, and a generous threshold connect every room to the outdoors.</p></section><section id=\\\"hillside\\\"><img src=\\\"/hillside.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Hillside Retreat illustration\\\" width=\\\"720\\\" height=\\\"680\\\"><h2>Hillside Retreat</h2><p>A compact timber house follows the shape of its landscape. A single broad roof creates a sheltered edge for watching the weather pass.</p></section></div><section id=\\\"contact\\\" class=\\\"contact\\\"><span class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">SAY HELLO</span><h2>Good things start<br>with a conversation.</h2><a href=\\\"mailto:hello@forma.example\\\">hello@forma.example \\xe2\\x86\\x97</a><p>Forma is a fictional studio built to demonstrate NeoKit. See the example README to make it your own.</p></section></article>\\n\""
expression Layout "concat(\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><title>\",html_escape(p_title),\" \\xc2\\xb7 Forma</title><meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"A small architecture studio creating thoughtful places to live.\\\"><link rel=\\\"icon\\\" href=\\\"/favicon.svg\\\" type=\\\"image/svg+xml\\\"><link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"/_web/site-1d0d876e6744.css\\\"></head><body data-render-mode=\\\"\",html_escape(p_mode),\"\\\"><a class=\\\"skip\\\" href=\\\"#web-page\\\">Skip to content</a><header class=\\\"site-header wrap\\\"><a class=\\\"brand\\\" href=\\\"/\\\" aria-label=\\\"Forma home\\\">forma<span>\\xc2\\xae</span></a><nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\"><a href=\\\"/#work\\\">Selected work</a><a href=\\\"/studio\\\">The studio</a><a class=\\\"contact-link\\\" href=\\\"/studio#contact\\\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\xe2\\x86\\x97</span></a></nav></header><main id=\\\"web-page\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\">\",p_content.bytes,\"</main><footer class=\\\"wrap footer\\\"><a class=\\\"brand\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">forma<span>\\xc2\\xae</span></a><p>Thoughtful by design. Native by NeoKit.</p><span class=\\\"speed\\\" data-performance><i></i><output>Server-rendered HTML</output></span></footer>\",(if p_client then \"<script type=\\\"module\\\" src=\\\"/_web/client-mdw7azs3.js\\\"></script>\" else \"\"),\"</body></html>\\n\")"
